WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
Liu Xiuer, just say it directly

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,600
Why do you want us to practice with you?

3
00:00:04,680 --> 00:00:05,920
You don't need to think too much

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,520
you just need to know

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:09,360
want to be a useful person

6
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:11,680
Become a useful person to your benefactor

7
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:15,790
You just need to listen to me Liu Xiuer

8
00:00:16,110 --> 00:00:17,270
You used to be a village beauty

9
00:00:17,390 --> 00:00:20,310
We listen to Liu Xiuer who is the most beautiful

10
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:21,550
I was not convinced by you before

11
00:00:21,750 --> 00:00:24,310
But for the sake of that gangster on your face, I'll go with you.

12
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:27,900
I also share the labor with you.

13
00:00:28,670 --> 00:00:30,110
We will definitely meet again

14
00:00:30,350 --> 00:00:39,790
Is the young master here?

15
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:42,210
Three days of loess

16
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:44,900
Finally stepped on the border of Yuanzhou border town

17
00:00:47,830 --> 00:00:50,290
How many people are you two?

18
00:00:50,810 --> 00:00:52,450
Please let the people in the carriage come out.

19
00:00:52,730 --> 00:00:57,370
I need to check my identity. Liu Xiuer, please come out.
